<title>USA: HRE sells property for $8.6 mln.</title>
<headline>HRE sells property for $8.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>HRE Properties said Friday that it has sold one of its non-core properties for $8.6 million.</p>
<p>The property, known as One Denver Highlands, a 122,000 square foot office building in Denver, Colorado, was sold at its approximate net book value, HRE said.</p>
